{"claim_id": "R1-27", "task_id": "CT-R1-AUDIT-R4-GATE1", "claim": "Gate 1 found a real defect: DLMF (5.11.12) was misquoted in theorem.tex as the full G_k expansion. Verified independently against dlmf.nist.gov: (5.11.12) is Gamma(z+a)/Gamma(z+b) ~ z^(a-b) for |ph z| <= pi - delta; the expansion with G_k(a,b) is (5.11.13); G_0(a,b)=1 is (5.11.15). The proof only ever needed (5.11.12), so the mathematics is unaffected and the citation was corrected at five sites in theorem.tex; the document recompiles clean at 7 pages.", "label": "INSPECTED", "evidence_type": "file_inspection", "dps": null, "reproducible": true, "script": "sessions/2026-09-17/CT-R1-AUDIT/apply_audit_r4.py", "output_hash": null}
